<title>LEBANON: Lebanon markets closed for Eid al-Adha holiday.</title>
<headline>Lebanon markets closed for Eid al-Adha holiday.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lebanon's financial markets are closed on Thursday and Friday for the Moslem Eid al-Adha feast holiday.</p>
</text>
